#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:43
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"擬ポテンシャルのファイルは ``Cu.pbe-dn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF`` です。\\ k点メッシュとスメアリング幅は、 "
":doc:`../kpoints/kpoint_convergence` で決めた条件です。\\ "
"このメッシュでは、格子定数を変えたときのエネルギー差が0.1 meV、圧力が0.2 kbarの精度で収束しています。\\ "
"カットオフエネルギーの影響を調べるため、 :numref:`{number}節 <sec-cl-cutoff>` "
"では波動関数のカットオフを40、80、100、120 Ry（電荷密度はその10倍）にした計算も行います。"
msgstr ""
"The pseudopotential file is ``Cu.pbe-dn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF``. \\ We use "
"the k-point mesh and smearing width determined in "
":doc:`../kpoints/kpoint_convergence`. \\ With this mesh, the energy "
"differences between lattice constants are converged to 0.1 meV and the "
"pressure to 0.2 kbar. \\ To test the effect of the cutoff energy, in "
":numref:`Section {number} <sec-cl-cutoff>` we also ran calculations at "
"wave function cutoffs of 40, 80, 100, and 120 Ry, with charge density "
"cutoffs 10 times as high."

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:51
msgid "エネルギー曲線"
msgstr "Energy Curves"

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:53
msgid ""
"格子定数を3.52 Åから3.76 Åまで0.02 Åずつ変えた13点で、全エネルギーと圧力を計算しました（ :numref:`fig-cl-"
"eos` ）。\\ 1点のSCF計算は、MPI 4並列で約20秒です。"
msgstr ""
"We calculated the total energy and pressure at 13 lattice constants from "
"3.52 Å to 3.76 Å in increments of 0.02 Å (:numref:`fig-cl-eos`). \\ Each "
"SCF calculation took about 20 seconds on 4 MPI processes."

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:60
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Cuの格子定数 :math:`a` と全エネルギー（左）、圧力（右）。青い点はSCF計算、灰色の曲線は13点にBirch–Murnaghanの式（"
" :numref:`{number}節 <sec-cl-eos>` ）を当てはめた結果で、右はその曲線を体積で微分した圧力 "
":math:`-\\mathrm{d}E/\\mathrm{d}V` です。左の縦軸は、当てはめた曲線の極小値 :math:`E_0` "
"からのエネルギー、点線は極小の位置です。"
msgstr ""
"Total energy (left) and pressure (right) versus the lattice constant "
":math:`a` of Cu. Blue points show the SCF results. The gray curve on the "
"left is the Birch–Murnaghan fit to the 13 points (:numref:`Section "
"{number} <sec-cl-eos>`), and the gray curve on the right is the "
"corresponding pressure :math:`-\\mathrm{d}E/\\mathrm{d}V` from "
"differentiating the fit with respect to volume. The vertical axis on the "
"left shows the energy relative to the fitted minimum :math:`E_0`, and the"
" dotted line marks its position."

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:62
msgid ""
"エネルギーは3.62 Åと3.64 Åでほぼ等しく（差0.05 meV）、極小はこの間にあります。\\ 曲線は左右対称ではありません。\\ "
"計算範囲の両端（3.52 Åと3.76 Å）は、どちらも極小のエネルギーより約50 meV高くなっています。\\ 極小は約3.63 "
"Åにあるので、縮めた側は0.11 Å、伸ばした側は0.13 Åの変化で同程度のエネルギー上昇に達します。\\ "
"原子どうしが近づくと反発が急に強くなるため、縮める側のほうが硬いのです。\\ "
"右の圧力も、格子定数に対して直線ではなく、縮めた側で傾きが急になっています。"
msgstr ""
"The energies at 3.62 Å and 3.64 Å are nearly equal (a difference of 0.05 "
"meV), and the minimum lies between them. \\ The curve is asymmetric. \\ "
"At both ends of the calculation range (3.52 Å and 3.76 Å), the energy is "
"about 50 meV above the minimum. \\ With the minimum at about 3.63 Å, a "
"compression of 0.11 Å or an expansion of 0.13 Å gives a similar energy "
"increase. \\ Repulsion rises sharply as the atoms approach one another, "
"making the lattice stiffer under compression. \\ The pressure on the "
"right is also nonlinear in the lattice constant and has a steeper slope "
"on the compressed side."

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:72
msgid "2次式の当てはめ"
msgstr "Fitting a Quadratic"

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:74
msgid ""
"最も簡単な求め方は、極小付近の点に2次式 :math:`E(a)=c_0+c_1a+c_2a^2` を当てはめ、その頂点 "
":math:`a_0=-c_1/(2c_2)` を格子定数とする方法です。\\ 当てはめる範囲を、3.63 Åを中心に広げていったときの "
":math:`a_0` を :numref:`tab-cl-quadratic` と :numref:`fig-cl-quadratic` "
"に示します。"
msgstr ""
"The simplest method is to fit a quadratic :math:`E(a)=c_0+c_1a+c_2a^2` to"
" the points near the minimum and use the lattice constant at its vertex, "
":math:`a_0=-c_1/(2c_2)`. \\ The values of :math:`a_0` as the fitting "
"range widens around 3.63 Å are shown in :numref:`tab-cl-quadratic` and "
":numref:`fig-cl-quadratic`."

