#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:224
msgid ""
"SCFの回数は、最後に平面波を選び直したSCF計算を除いた回数です。\\ 3.64 Åから始めると、3回のSCF計算で3.6299 "
"Åに収束し、SCFの圧力が0になる格子定数（3.6298 Å）とほぼ一致しました。\\ "
"しかし、開始点を変えると、最適化後の格子定数は3.6287〜3.6302 Åと0.0015 Åの幅で散らばります。"
msgstr ""
"The count of SCF calculations excludes the final SCF calculation, which "
"uses a newly selected set of plane waves. \\ Starting at 3.64 Å, the "
"lattice constant converged to 3.6299 Å in 3 SCF calculations, nearly "
"matching the lattice constant at which the SCF pressure is zero (3.6298 "
"Å). \\ However, varying the starting value gives optimized lattice "
"constants from 3.6287 to 3.6302 Å, a spread of 0.0015 Å."

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:228
msgid ""
"この散らばりも、平面波の扱いによるものです。\\ ``vc-relax`` "
"では、格子を動かしている間、開始時の格子で選んだ平面波の組をそのまま使います。\\ "
"開始点が極小から離れていると、最適化後の格子では、カットオフエネルギーで本来選ぶべき組と違う平面波で計算していることになります。\\ "
"QEは、最適化が終わったあとに、最後の格子で平面波を選び直してもう一度SCF計算を行います（出力の ``The G-vectors are "
"recalculated for the final unit cell`` ）。\\ その圧力（表の右端）は、3.56 "
"Åから始めた場合で1.39 kbarと、収束閾値（0.1 kbar）より大きく残っています。\\ 3.56 Åから始めた結果（3.6287 "
"Å）を開始点にして ``vc-relax`` をやり直すと、3.6299 Åに収束し、最後のSCFの圧力は0.02 "
"kbarになりました（表の最後の行）。\\ 3.64 Åから始めた結果と一致します。\\ "
"最後のSCFの圧力の絶対値が閾値より大きいときは、得られた格子から ``vc-relax`` をやり直すと、開始点による違いがなくなります。"
msgstr ""
"This spread also comes from how the calculation treats plane waves. \\ "
"``vc-relax`` keeps the set of plane waves selected for the starting "
"lattice throughout relaxation. \\ If the starting point is far from the "
"minimum, the set of plane waves used for the optimized lattice differs "
"from the set the cutoff energy would select for that lattice. \\ After "
"optimization, QE reselects the plane waves for the final lattice and runs"
" one more SCF calculation (see ``The G-vectors are recalculated for the "
"final unit cell`` in the output). \\ Starting at 3.56 Å leaves a pressure"
" of 1.39 kbar in that calculation (rightmost column), above the "
"convergence threshold of 0.1 kbar. \\ Rerunning ``vc-relax`` from the "
"result of the 3.56 Å run (3.6287 Å) gave a converged lattice constant of "
"3.6299 Å and a final SCF pressure of 0.02 kbar (last row). \\ This "
"matches the result from starting at 3.64 Å. \\ When the magnitude of the "
"final SCF pressure exceeds the threshold, rerunning ``vc-relax`` from the"
" optimized lattice removes the dependence on the starting value."

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:240
msgid "カットオフエネルギーと格子定数"
msgstr "Cutoff Energy and Lattice Constants"

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:242
msgid ""
"エネルギー曲線と応力のどちらで求めた格子定数が、カットオフエネルギーに対して早く収束するかを調べます。\\ カットオフを40〜120 "
"Ryに変え、それぞれ3.60〜3.68 Åの5点でエネルギー曲線と圧力を計算し、3.64 Åから ``vc-relax`` を行いました（ "
":numref:`tab-cl-cutoff` 、 :numref:`fig-cl-cutoff` の左）。\\ "
"エネルギー曲線の格子定数は、この5点にBirch–Murnaghanの式を当てはめて求めました。"
msgstr ""
"We compare how quickly the lattice constant converges with cutoff energy "
"when obtained from the energy curve or from stress. \\ We varied the "
"cutoff from 40 to 120 Ry and, for each cutoff, calculated the energy "
"curve and pressure at 5 points from 3.60 to 3.68 Å and ran ``vc-relax`` "
"from 3.64 Å (:numref:`tab-cl-cutoff` and the left panel of :numref:`fig-"
"cl-cutoff`). \\ We obtained the lattice constant from the energy curve by"
" fitting the Birch–Murnaghan equation to these 5 points."

#: ../../cu_lattice/lattice_constant.rst:246
